(753, 1, '2026-06-22 15:57:12', '2026-06-22 13:57:12', '<img width=\"561\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Todo-bien.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Todo-bien.png 561w, https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Todo-bien-300x43.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 561px) 100vw, 561px\" />													<p>Tout s\'aligne. Argentine - Perito Morezno - Novembre 2018. Un  nouveau souffle, des découvertes, une terre immense. Face au glacier, tout devient possible. Le voyage continue et l\'être se révèle. Respirer et sentir.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									COMMANDER\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"617\" height=\"552\" src=\"https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/boutique_carac_1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/boutique_carac_1.png 617w, https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/boutique_carac_1-300x268.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 617px) 100vw, 617px\" />																										<img width=\"800\" height=\"591\" src=\"https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/boutique_groupe_1-1024x757.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/boutique_groupe_1-1024x757.png 1024w, https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/boutique_groupe_1-300x222.png 300w, https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/boutique_groupe_1-768x568.png 768w, https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/boutique_groupe_1.png 1320w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />																										<img width=\"532\" height=\"204\" src=\"https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Groupe_18740.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Groupe_18740.png 532w, https://bgodbillot.alwaysdata.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/05